WEBVTT

00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:29.915
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:33.773
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:02:00.462 --> 00:02:02.760
There it is!

00:02:10.306 --> 00:02:11.535
There it is...

00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:13.803
Shooting Star...

00:02:25.054 --> 00:02:26.749
At last...

00:02:26.822 --> 00:02:29.382
That's who we're facing.

00:02:29.558 --> 00:02:31.686
But... It's so big!

00:02:54.984 --> 00:02:59.421
Sir Ashram's a real slave driver!
He wants us to leave in two days!

00:03:00.489 --> 00:03:04.119
Yeah! So much for making
money at being pirates!

00:03:15.571 --> 00:03:17.801
What's he doin' there?

00:03:17.873 --> 00:03:21.969
Well, it gives us something
to look at for a change, right?

00:03:33.722 --> 00:03:35.087
Why, you...!

00:03:41.664 --> 00:03:44.156
No charge for my dance.

00:03:47.603 --> 00:03:50.095
What a woman. I'm scared!

00:03:51.206 --> 00:03:53.698
You can see for yourself, Orson.

00:03:53.776 --> 00:03:56.905
| didn't need any backup
on this one.

00:03:57.046 --> 00:03:58.275
Right...

00:03:58.347 --> 00:04:00.611
Well, shall we go?

00:04:12.461 --> 00:04:15.624
At that moment, Slayn and Leylia,
who stayed behind in Raiden...

00:04:15.698 --> 00:04:18.292
...to gather a crew for a ship,
learned the shocking truth...

00:04:18.367 --> 00:04:21.860
...from a sailor who had fled
a pirate attack.

00:04:24.473 --> 00:04:27.704
Wh- What?! Is that true?!

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:31.580
Yeah. I saw it with my own eyes.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.314
That pirate ship is
a Marmo military ship.

00:04:35.384 --> 00:04:38.251
They had a huge coat of
arms flying from the mast.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:41.085
Marmo... Could it be Ashram?

00:04:41.724 --> 00:04:44.284
Dear, what should we do?

00:04:44.426 --> 00:04:47.760
All we CAN do:
believe in our friends and wait.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:51.130
Relief forces from Flaim
should arrive here in a few days.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.328
Parn and the others as well, so...

00:04:53.402 --> 00:04:57.066
But I still have a
bad feeling about this.

00:04:57.439 --> 00:04:58.634
Parn...

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.923
Deed...

00:05:19.995 --> 00:05:22.225
Be careful, Parn.

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:25.998
Now is the time!

00:05:26.068 --> 00:05:28.435
The time to attack the fire
dragon Shooting Star has come!

00:05:28.504 --> 00:05:30.268
Prepare to attack!

00:05:36.779 --> 00:05:39.680
Keep as much space between
each company as possible!

00:05:39.748 --> 00:05:41.477
Don't underestimate
the dragon's flames!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:44.315
Let's show that thing
what we're really made of!

00:05:44.386 --> 00:05:45.114
Yes, sir!

00:05:45.187 --> 00:05:48.020
Deed! I'll leave any
magical support to you.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.819
Right.

00:06:02.437 --> 00:06:05.236
Not yet. Let him get in range.

00:06:05.307 --> 00:06:08.675
I hear you!
But with this much firepower...

00:06:08.877 --> 00:06:10.436
...even a dragon has no chance!

00:06:10.512 --> 00:06:14.506
Let's see if we can pierce
his heart on the first attack!

00:06:17.019 --> 00:06:19.283
The wind... It's stopping?

00:06:19.354 --> 00:06:20.685
What's wrong, Deed?

00:06:20.756 --> 00:06:21.621
Here it comes!

00:06:22.457 --> 00:06:24.186
What?!

00:06:37.673 --> 00:06:39.300
You okay, Deed?!

00:06:39.374 --> 00:06:40.637
Yeah!

00:06:40.709 --> 00:06:43.542
Damn it! Here it comes again!

00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:57.819
You're shooting too soon!

00:06:57.893 --> 00:07:01.261
Wait for him to get
closer before you fire!

00:07:06.101 --> 00:07:08.126
I'll draw him in!

00:07:08.203 --> 00:07:10.900
While I do that,
Deed can summon the spirits!

00:07:10.973 --> 00:07:12.202
Parn!

00:07:12.274 --> 00:07:14.709
Cover Parn! Hee-yaa!

00:07:15.611 --> 00:07:17.943
King Kashue! Parn!

00:07:20.382 --> 00:07:22.316
Over here!

00:07:31.827 --> 00:07:35.559
Shoot! Shoot! Show that
beast the honor of Flaim!

00:07:44.072 --> 00:07:45.301
Damn you...!

00:07:45.374 --> 00:07:47.103
Hurry up, Deed!

00:07:51.046 --> 00:07:53.276
Here should do...

00:07:57.486 --> 00:08:01.616
"I summon thee, kuul,
great king of the wind!"

00:08:10.265 --> 00:08:12.825
"Make the wind become your sword..."

00:08:12.901 --> 00:08:16.997
"...and strike the demon
dragon with your whirlwind!"

00:08:30.319 --> 00:08:32.413
A wind spirit!

00:08:43.098 --> 00:08:45.692
Damn you... You monster!

00:09:16.164 --> 00:09:20.431
You pathetic humans
DARE to wound my body!

00:09:23.005 --> 00:09:25.702
I shall attack your cities!

00:09:25.907 --> 00:09:30.435
A hundred humans shall die for each
scale of mine you have scratched!

00:09:30.645 --> 00:09:33.671
I shall kill every last one of you!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:48.961
Parn!

00:09:49.031 --> 00:09:52.126
I'm... I'm all right...
But...

00:09:53.001 --> 00:09:56.801
If our army had had
even one sorcerer in it...

00:10:00.242 --> 00:10:03.337
We've lost...
We've failed...utterly.

00:10:07.883 --> 00:10:11.649
Sir Ashram, it appears
some people have infiltrated.

00:10:12.587 --> 00:10:14.055
Infiltrators?

00:10:14.122 --> 00:10:16.955
Yes. That reminds me, Smeddy.

00:10:17.426 --> 00:10:20.623
One of them is someone
you can't beat.

00:10:21.196 --> 00:10:25.531
There's a girl with them who outclasses
you in both youth and beauty.

00:10:25.901 --> 00:10:29.804
Oh? Does such a woman exist?
| like the sound of that.

00:10:30.705 --> 00:10:32.332
Right, Astar?

00:10:32.407 --> 00:10:34.603
Don't get your hopes up, Gaberra.

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:37.976
ANY woman is beautiful
compared to Smeddy.

00:10:40.115 --> 00:10:44.951
Smeddy's body is very beautiful.
At least I think so.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:49.657
That's all right, Gilram.
A warrior doesn't need beauty.

00:10:50.025 --> 00:10:53.552
Strength is everything.
I'll prove that to you.

00:10:55.363 --> 00:10:57.161
It sounds like fun, doesn't it?

00:10:57.232 --> 00:11:00.167
Coming here with such
a small force to attack us...

00:11:00.235 --> 00:11:04.638
Are they better than most, or simply
fools who don't know their limits?

00:11:04.706 --> 00:11:08.336
Or are they foolish enough
to be coming after ME?

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.604
| will test them with my own hands!

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.194
Looks like it's this way.

00:11:36.972 --> 00:11:39.566
What are you doing? Hurry.

00:11:39.641 --> 00:11:41.439
What am[...?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.376
Hurry...?

00:11:53.121 --> 00:11:56.614
Sheesh!
What's got them so distracted?

00:11:57.159 --> 00:11:58.957
How can they just
ignore all this treasure?

00:11:59.027 --> 00:11:59.687
Get going!

00:11:59.761 --> 00:12:01.627
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:04.562
That's the pirates' ship, all right!
No doubt about it!

00:12:04.633 --> 00:12:08.729
Good! That means we've
gotten what we came here for!

00:12:10.338 --> 00:12:11.066
Marmo.

00:12:12.607 --> 00:12:15.542
A Marmo military ship.
But why...?

00:12:16.178 --> 00:12:19.808
Which means... You don't
suppose Ashram's here?!

00:12:20.315 --> 00:12:22.613
I'm honored.

00:12:23.218 --> 00:12:27.485
To think that my name is known by
even common thieves like you.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.960
A black knight... That's Ashram.

00:12:33.195 --> 00:12:35.323
That girl, huh?

00:12:37.132 --> 00:12:39.430
Calm down, Shirts.

00:12:40.035 --> 00:12:43.471
Don't worry about me.
I'm a warrior, remember?

00:12:43.538 --> 00:12:47.133
| want to know who sent them.
Leave a few alive.

00:12:48.143 --> 00:12:49.668
Hobb!

00:12:49.744 --> 00:12:52.941
"Great god Myrii,
who rules over war."

00:12:53.748 --> 00:12:58.549
"Gather heroes here! Grant us thy
divine protection in the coming battle!"

00:13:00.622 --> 00:13:05.753
"Give us the resolve of iron
and the courage of fire!"

00:13:17.839 --> 00:13:21.776
So, this is the power of Myrii
I've heard so much about!

00:13:30.218 --> 00:13:34.519
So, this is how it feels to have
power welling up inside of you!

00:13:38.994 --> 00:13:41.429
You're not half bad, little girl.

00:13:41.496 --> 00:13:44.830
My name is NOT "little girl".
It's Shirts!

00:13:49.204 --> 00:13:51.901
You're pretty good, aren't you?

00:13:52.807 --> 00:13:57.438
Don't underestimate me! I learned
all I know about fighting from Parn!

00:13:59.214 --> 00:14:03.310
"Manna of all creation...
Become the fires of destruction!"

00:14:15.664 --> 00:14:19.294
Y- You've gotta be kidding!
This guy's a monster!

00:14:20.468 --> 00:14:24.234
Who are you people?!
I'll wager you work for Kashue!

00:14:26.641 --> 00:14:30.100
If you're not going to answer me...
Then die!

00:14:39.287 --> 00:14:43.349
Soul Crusher is reacting to him!
What is this man?!

00:14:50.799 --> 00:14:53.200
There's nothing left to say!
Now die!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.572
You're hardly worth any effort, boy.

00:15:04.646 --> 00:15:08.776
Enough! Enough! You've beat me!
| said I was sorry, okay?!

00:15:14.155 --> 00:15:17.125
"Power of manna, remake the air."

00:15:17.359 --> 00:15:19.953
"Let his heart fall into
deep slumber.”

00:15:20.028 --> 00:15:22.588
What are you...doing...?

00:15:26.968 --> 00:15:29.733
What, starting to get
winded already, little girl?

00:15:29.804 --> 00:15:32.171
Such a poor showing!

00:15:37.979 --> 00:15:38.946
You fool!

00:15:43.184 --> 00:15:44.652
Gotcha!

00:15:44.719 --> 00:15:46.778
Lousy move, little girl.

00:15:52.394 --> 00:15:55.523
Surrender!
You know you can't beat me.

00:15:57.465 --> 00:15:59.229
Who IS this man?!

00:16:05.373 --> 00:16:07.171
Shirts!

00:16:43.578 --> 00:16:46.843
Rage... Destroy...
Destroy everything!

00:16:51.186 --> 00:16:51.846
What?!

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.617
Smeddy!
This guy's...strong!

00:17:00.061 --> 00:17:02.223
So, that is your true power.

00:17:02.297 --> 00:17:05.562
You were only playing
with me until now!

00:17:10.939 --> 00:17:12.407
What an amusing fellow!

00:17:12.474 --> 00:17:14.272
Now to show you the power of
Soul Crusher, the demon sword...

00:17:14.342 --> 00:17:17.710
...which can smash
the soul of any warrior!

00:17:30.325 --> 00:17:33.556
Wait. Don't go! Don't go yet!

00:17:34.762 --> 00:17:37.356
I still have to beat this man!

00:17:37.432 --> 00:17:41.232
For Shiris's sake...
I still need your power!

00:17:44.706 --> 00:17:46.731
Orson, don't do it...

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:54.678
Don't do it! Don't let it
take control...of your heart!

00:17:55.617 --> 00:17:57.847
You're..alive...

00:17:57.919 --> 00:18:00.081
I'm... 'm all right.

00:18:01.356 --> 00:18:03.188
Thank goodness.

00:18:03.258 --> 00:18:08.560
You've lost to me.
Now surrender quietly, otherwise...

00:18:12.133 --> 00:18:16.001
Spare the ones who are
still alive. I'm their leader.

00:18:26.848 --> 00:18:28.839
| was naive.

00:18:29.417 --> 00:18:32.580
Thinking that a large army
was enough to slay a dragon...

00:18:32.654 --> 00:18:34.588
| was a fool!

00:18:34.656 --> 00:18:37.682
A hundred people for every scale...

00:18:38.593 --> 00:18:41.062
Just who does he think he is?!

00:18:41.129 --> 00:18:43.996
Parn... What are we going to do now?

00:18:44.065 --> 00:18:47.000
From here on,
| am an ordinary warrior!

00:18:47.068 --> 00:18:49.332
Until that fire dragon is dead!

00:18:49.404 --> 00:18:54.274
Shadam! Gather the wounded
and take them back to Blade!

00:18:54.342 --> 00:18:56.709
B- But, King Kashue!

00:18:57.278 --> 00:18:59.474
What about you?!

00:19:00.548 --> 00:19:04.314
We're going to need a magic
user if we're to kill that dragon!

00:19:04.385 --> 00:19:07.082
I'm going to Raiden to see Slayn!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:12.217
Kashue, Parn, and Deed urged their
steeds to run fast as they dared...

00:19:12.293 --> 00:19:15.228
...as they raced
to the city of Raiden.

00:19:15.296 --> 00:19:18.960
Ashram has already set
out for Blue Dragon Island.

00:19:19.734 --> 00:19:23.261
Taking Orson and the
others with him as well...

00:19:31.713 --> 00:19:33.511
Shirts...

00:19:41.889 --> 00:19:43.050
Welcome...

00:19:43.124 --> 00:19:44.683
...to Lodoss Island!

00:19:44.759 --> 00:19:46.090
And now, what you've
all been waiting for...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.924
...the second half of the show!

00:19:52.033 --> 00:19:55.162
Parn and the others,
hoping to slay Shooting Star-...

00:19:55.236 --> 00:19:59.104
...have journeyed to the fire
dragon's feeding grounds.

00:19:59.173 --> 00:20:02.108
Don't slow DOWN so soon
after the narration!

00:20:02.176 --> 00:20:04.076
You're just going to screw us UP!

00:20:04.646 --> 00:20:07.946
| wonder what sort
of dragon Shooting Star is.

00:20:08.016 --> 00:20:09.177
I'm so excited!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.777
Oh... Hurry up and face us!
I'll show you what I've got!

00:20:14.689 --> 00:20:16.657
Wow, Parn.
You're really excited about this!

00:20:18.426 --> 00:20:20.326
Oh, my... What a weak hero.

00:20:21.629 --> 00:20:22.755
Shooting Star, you fiend!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.856
King Kashue of
Flaim fears nothing!

00:20:33.941 --> 00:20:35.739
Huh? Is that...?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:38.677
Shooting Star...?!
He's so cute!

00:20:41.082 --> 00:20:42.140
This is a dragon?

00:20:42.216 --> 00:20:45.413
<i>Oh..} st he the cutest
thing you've ever seen?!</i>

00:20:45.486 --> 00:20:50.447
Let's go, Shooting Star! Now I'll
show you the might of Flaim!

00:20:54.896 --> 00:20:57.922
How dare you do that to King Kashue!

00:20:57.999 --> 00:21:02.766
Don't cry like that! You make me look
like some big villain or something!

00:21:03.204 --> 00:21:06.868
In this case, we'll use
magic to defeat the beast!

00:21:08.109 --> 00:21:09.372
Um... But...

00:21:09.444 --> 00:21:10.434
Go to it!

00:21:10.511 --> 00:21:14.106
"I summon thee, I-Luuk,
great king of the wind!"

00:21:16.918 --> 00:21:20.047
Well?! How do you
like that, dragon?!

00:21:29.831 --> 00:21:33.699
Way to go, Dragon! You've got
some great magic power!

00:22:59.153 --> 00:23:02.123
Defeat. And now a new battle begins.

00:23:02.924 --> 00:23:06.189
Awakened from his long sleep, the rage
of the sea dragon shakes the heavens!

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:08.820
The black knight's demon
sword lights the darkness!

00:23:08.896 --> 00:23:11.228
And in the heart of a berserker...

00:23:11.299 --> 00:23:14.098
...a long-forgotten
light flares to new life!

00:23:14.168 --> 00:23:17.934
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.005 --> 00:23:20.565
Heart... Tears Reborn
